    "title": "Shop Samsung",
    "description": "The best way to shop the latest Galaxy Z Fold6, Z Flip6, Watch Ultra, Watch7, Ring, Buds3 Pro, Buds3 and more. Shop the curated deals, get personalized recommendations, and unlock exclusive offers on Shop Samsung app.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Galaxy AI is here\r\nMeet the new Galaxy Z Fold6, Z Flip6, Watch Ultra, Watch7, Ring, Buds3 Pro and Buds3. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf81 Get $50 off when you spend $500 or more on your first Shop Samsung app purchase\r\n\r\n\u23f0 Stay updated on the best deals of the latest Samsung products \r\nReceive notifications to get the best deals on the new Galaxy Z Fold6, Z Flip6, Watch Ultra, Watch7, Ring, Buds3 Pro, Buds3 and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Flex your watch with Samsung Design Studio\r\nPersonalize your unique new Galaxy Watch Ultra or Galaxy Watch7. Choose your case and band and explore your combination in Samsung Design Studio.\r\n\r\nDesign your space with BESPOKE Design Studio\r\nStart customizing your BESPOKE 4-Door Flex \u1d40\u1d39 refrigerators with eight available colors and two finishes. Plus, get 100 days to buy and try and 90 days to exchange front door panels. \u03c7\r\n\r\nEarn Samsung Rewards and redeem points\r\nLog in with your Samsung account and earn up to 1.5% reward points with the purchase of select products. Check and redeem your Samsung Rewards points with one click.\r\n \r\nPay over-time with Samsung Financing**\r\n- Choose Samsung Financing during checkout for any order of $49 or more.\r\n- Get approved in seconds and receive monthly detailed billing statements.\r\n- A revolving line of credit will be loaded to your account so you can keep using it on any future purchase on Shop Samsung App or Samsung.com.\r\n\r\nFlexible payment options\r\nQuick checkout and pay with flexible options including Samsung Pay***, PayPal, Amazon Pay, or Pay in 4 installations with Affirm.\r\n  \r\nFree shipping, free return. Safe, contact-free delivery to your door.\r\n\r\nStart Shopping!\r\n\r\nLearn more:\r\nhttps://www.samsung.com/us/apps/shop-samsung-app/ \r\n\r\n\r\n**Subject to credit approval. Terms apply. Open the app for details.\r\n***Samsung Pay is available with select cards from participating banks on Samsung devices.\r\n\u03c7Terms and conditions apply.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The best way to shop the latest Galaxy Z Fold6, Z Flip6, Watch Ultra, Watch7, Ring, Buds3 Pro, Buds3 and more. Shop the curated deals, get personalized recommendations, and unlock exclusive offers on Shop Samsung app.<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 Galaxy AI is here<br>Meet the new Galaxy Z Fold6, Z Flip6, Watch Ultra, Watch7, Ring, Buds3 Pro and Buds3. <br><br>\ud83c\udf81 Get $50 off when you spend $500 or more on your first Shop Samsung app purchase<br><br>\u23f0 Stay updated on the best deals of the latest Samsung products <br>Receive notifications to get the best deals on the new Galaxy Z Fold6, Z Flip6, Watch Ultra, Watch7, Ring, Buds3 Pro, Buds3 and more.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Flex your watch with Samsung Design Studio<br>Personalize your unique new Galaxy Watch Ultra or Galaxy Watch7. Choose your case and band and explore your combination in Samsung Design Studio.<br><br>Design your space with BESPOKE Design Studio<br>Start customizing your BESPOKE 4-Door Flex \u1d40\u1d39 refrigerators with eight available colors and two finishes. Plus, get 100 days to buy and try and 90 days to exchange front door panels. \u03c7<br><br>Earn Samsung Rewards and redeem points<br>Log in with your Samsung account and earn up to 1.5% reward points with the purchase of select products. Check and redeem your Samsung Rewards points with one click.<br> <br>Pay over-time with Samsung Financing**<br>- Choose Samsung Financing during checkout for any order of $49 or more.<br>- Get approved in seconds and receive monthly detailed billing statements.<br>- A revolving line of credit will be loaded to your account so you can keep using it on any future purchase on Shop Samsung App or Samsung.com.<br><br>Flexible payment options<br>Quick checkout and pay with flexible options including Samsung Pay***, PayPal, Amazon Pay, or Pay in 4 installations with Affirm.<br>  <br>Free shipping, free return. Safe, contact-free delivery to your door.<br><br>Start Shopping!<br><br>Learn more:<